      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A patient with a history of 20 years of intermittent pain and swelling of the floor of the mouth was diagnosed with bilateral multiple sialoliths of the submandibular ducts. Subsequent to the excision of all the sialoliths, the patient was asymptomatic. She will be observed periodically."},
